# Git already detects these as binary (NUL bytes in the first 8KB), so this file is
# belt-and-braces: it guarantees no end-of-line rewriting on a Windows clone, and
# -delta stops Git attempting delta compression between unrelated audio clips.
#
# Deliberately NOT Git LFS: GitHub Pages does not resolve LFS objects, so the site
# would serve the pointer text instead of the audio.
*.mp3 binary -delta
